# Rename Sheet

::summary
The doc rename sheet, reached from the doc detail's ⋯ menu: a single title field pre-filled with the current title; Enter or Save commits. Canonical standalone source for the `rename` sheet anchored by `surfaces/doc-detail.surf`.
::

::modal[name=rename title="Rename" width=320 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::form[name=rename submit="Save" action=saveRename]
- Document title (text, "tidepool — Spec") *
:::

Pre-filled with the current title (the placeholder carries it here — prefill is state layer); Enter also commits.

::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon; Esc dismisses without committing.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
